  "difficulty": 3,
  "marks": 6,
  "estimatedSeconds": 540,
  "stem": "The discrete random variable $X$ has the probability distribution below, and $\\mathrm{E}(X) = 2.6$.\n\n| x | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| P(X = x) | 0.2 | p | q | 0.25 |",
